WEBVTT

00:00.000 --> 00:06.600
an estimated 624,000 migrants journeying into the United States.

00:06.600 --> 00:07.280
Think of that.

00:07.280 --> 00:10.440
The UN is supporting people that are illegally coming

00:10.440 --> 00:12.760
into the United States, and then we have to get them out.

